{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"01eb5eb3-c83c-45d1-8310-66f4645ca319","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full question space. Q4.3 is about Memory Hierarchy's impact on kernel design and scheduling in MoE/DiT/Multimodal/Video models under multi-operator/micro-operator concurrency scenarios. Let me now follow the workflow:\n\n1. Extract pre-keywords for Q4.3\n2. Semantic segmentation of the question into logical chain nodes\n3. Four-directory parallel search for each node\n4. De-duplicate and read top 15-20 notes\n5. Write the answer\n\nLet me start with the semantic segmentation and then do the searches.\n\n**Semantic Segmentation of Q4.3:**\n\nThe question is: \"在 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 四类模型的多算子/微算子并发场景下，Memory Hierarchy（register file → shared memory/L1 → L2 cache → HBM/GDDR/global memory → host memory）如何影响 kernel 设计与调度？\"\n\nLet me break it into logical chain nodes:\n\nS1: register file - registers per thread vs occupancy, MoE expert weight register tiling, DiT attention QKV register caching\nS2: shared memory - how to divide among micro-operators, bank conflict impact, shared memory size limitations (H100 228KB/SM, A100 164KB/SM)\nS3: L2 cache - cache residency strategy, cache thrashing with multi-kernel concurrency\nS4: global memory (HBM/GDDR) - coalesced access, MoE scattered memory access, bandwidth contention\nS5: NPU on-chip buffer / TPU VPU memory - different memory hierarchy, impact on tiling and concurrency\nS6: Hardware architecture focus - shared memory banking, L1/SMEM unified, HBM3/HBM3e bandwidth bottlenecks\n\nLet me now search for each node across the four directories. I'll start with Level A (long match) for each node.","signature":"01eb5eb3-c83c-45d1-8310-66f4645ca319"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":28000,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d6a322e-e190-4fae-a1dc-72c6a5bf18c5","uuid":"04675958-f493-4a5d-8d39-011dec547c6c"}
