{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"01eb5eb3-c83c-45d1-8310-66f4645ca319","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll execute the Answer Agent workflow for Q4.3. Let me start with semantic segmentation and vault searches.\n\n## Step 1: 语义分割\n\n**Q4.3 逻辑链条拆分：**\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|\n| S1 | register file — registers per thread 对 occupancy 的限制，MoE expert weight 的 register tiling，DiT attention QKV register 缓存 | 对象/约束 | register file, occupancy, register tiling, QKV register cache |\n| S2 | shared memory — 多微算子间划分，bank conflict 影响并发访存吞吐，shared memory 大小 (H100 228KB/SM, A100 164KB/SM) 限制 tile size | 对象/约束 | shared memory partitioning, bank conflict, tile size constraint |\n| S3 | L2 cache — L2 cache residency 策略与多 kernel 并发时的 cache thrashing | 对象/约束 | L2 cache residency, cache thrashing, multi-kernel concurrency |\n| S4 | global memory (HBM/GDDR) — 合并访问对 bandwidth 利用率影响，MoE expert weight 分散访存的带宽竞争 | 对象/约束 | coalesced access, bandwidth utilization, MoE scattered access |\n| S5 | NPU 片上 buffer / TPU VPU memory — 不同于 GPU memory hierarchy 的影响 | 对象/硬件对比 | NPU buffer, TPU VPU, memory hierarchy differences |\n| S6 | 硬件体系结构侧重 — shared memory banking、L1/SMEM 统一架构、HBM3/HBM3e 带宽瓶颈 | 约束/硬件侧重 | memory banking, L1/SMEM unified, HBM3/HBM3e bandwidth |\n\nNow let me search across four directories for each node. I'll start with Level A (long match) searches in parallel.\n\n### Step 1.3: 四目录并行搜索 — Level A"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":28000,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d6a322e-e190-4fae-a1dc-72c6a5bf18c5","uuid":"d7b0abb3-b759-4c85-9a25-9f82c3e56b27"}
