,{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":23},{\"match\":\"L2 Cache\",\"offset\":86},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":104},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":115},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":152},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":186},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":238},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":278},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":406},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":516},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":542},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":639},{\"match\":\"cache\",\"offset\":653},{\"match\":\"cache\",\"offset\":670},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":819},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":937},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":1028},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":1219},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1501},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":1508},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":1573},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":1657},{\"match\":\"Cache\",\"offset\":1768}],\"excerpt\":\"L2 Cache Affinity（L2 缓存亲和性 / L2 数据局部性）是指 GPU 上不同 SM 执行 tile 时通过共享 L2 cache 复用数据的能力。GPU 的所有 SM 共享统一的 L2 cache，当多个 SM 在同一 wave 中访问重叠的数据区域时，后续 SM 的请求可以直接从 L2 cache 命中，避免昂贵的 DRAM 读取。HyTiS 通过两机制优化 L2 cache affinity：(1) tile layout scheduling——选择合适的 Group-M/Group-N 布局使同一 wave 内相邻 SM 访问数据有最大重叠；(2) wave 粒度分析——量化每一 wave 的 DRAM→L2 流量 V_i 并最小化 total V_tol。\\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语，比如术语如…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block Order Scheduling _ L2 Cache Reuse (GPU).md\",\"basename\":\"Block Order Scheduling _ L2 Cache Reuse (GPU)\",\"score\":2065.183959497306,\"foundWords\":[\"l2\",\"l2。\",\"cache\",\"cache）。当相邻执行的\",\"cache（50mb,\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernels\",\"l2 cache\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":158},{\"match\":\"L2 Cache\",\"offset\":28},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":158},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":222},{\"match\":\"L2 cache\",\"offset\":261},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":344},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":435},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":456},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":656},{\"match\":\"cache\",\"offset\":786},{\"match\":\"L2\",\"offset\":825},{\"