et":738},{"match":"L2","offset":750},{"match":"cache","offset":1052},{"match":"cache","offset":1106},{"match":"Cache","offset":1158},{"match":"cache","offset":1186},{"match":"cache","offset":1879},{"match":"Cache","offset":2040},{"match":"cache","offset":2072}],"excerpt":"…hiplet通过高密度封装（如interposer、硅桥）集成为单个逻辑GPU的架构。与传统的monolithic GPU（单个大die制造）不同，multi-chiplet GPU将计算资源（SM、cache、memory controller等）分布到多个物理die上，各chiplet之间通过inter-chiplet interconnect（如interposer上的NoC或crossbar）通信。每个chiplet包含多个SM及其私有L1 cache、一个chiplet内共享的cache层（如L1.5或L2 cache）、一个全局LLC slice和一个本地DRAM partition。所有chiplet的DRAM partition共同提供统一的全局内存地址空间（single logical GPU abstraction），对编程模型完全透明——CUDA kernel、数据结…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md","basename":"GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM)","score":149.0072284184993,"foundWords":["l2","cache","cache**——on-chip，40mb，连接所有sm（streaming","kernel优化的标准方法论——nvidia的cuda","kernel优化的标准方法论","l2 cache"],"matches":[{"match":"L2 Cache","offset":266},{"match":"Cache","offset":364},{"match":"L2 Cache","offset":918},{"match":"Cache","offset":1168},{"match":"L2","offset":1377},{"match":"kernel优化的标准方法论——NVIDIA的CUDA","offset":2169}],"excerpt":"…HBM (High Bandwidth Memory)**——off-chip DRAM，40-80GB容量，带宽1.5-2.0TB/s，是GPU的主内存，存储模型参数、激活值和中间张量；(2) **L2 Cache**——on-chip，40MB，连接所有SM（Streaming Multiprocessors）；(3) **On-chip SRAM (Shared Memory + L1 Cache)**——per SM，共192KB（可配置split between shared memory and L1），带宽约19TB/s（~10× faster than HBM）；(4) **Registers**——per thread，最快但最小（每SM 65536 registers = 256KB）。越靠近计算单元的内存越快但越小，呈现经典的memory hierarchy pyra…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tile Layout (Group-M _ Group-N).md","basename":"Tile Layout (Group-M _ Group-N)","score":141.662525964937,"foundWords":["l2","cache","kernel知识笔记","l2 cache"],"matches":[{"match":"L2 cache","offset":112},{"match":"L2 cache","offset":112},{"match":"L2 cache","offset":370},{"match":"L2","offset":438},{"match":"L2","offset":481},{"match":"L2","offset":495},{"match":"Cach","offset":1267}],"excerpt":"Tile Layout 是 GPU GEMM 中 output tile 的空间排列顺序，决定 SM 执行 tile 的顺序以及相邻 SM 访问数据在 L2 cache 中的复用程度。四种基本 layout：Column-Major（按列排 tile）、Row-Major（按行排）、Group-M（以 group size s 将 M 维 tile 编组后排成列）、Group-N（以 group size s 将 N 维 tile 编组后排成行）。Column-Major = (GM, ceil(M/bM))，Row-Major = (GN, ceil(N/bN))。\n从kernel调度角度拆解：Tile layout 影响同一 wave 内相邻 SM 的 L2 cache 数据复用——相邻 tile 沿 M 维需要相同 A 行，沿 N 维…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Streaming Multiprocessor (SM).md","basename":"Streaming Multiprocessor (SM)","score":139.7289892714276,"foundWords":["l2","cache","cache。在本文研究的","cache。每个","kernel","l2 cache"],"matches":[{"match":"Cache。在本文研究的","offset":144},{"match":"L2 Cache","offset":236},{"match":"kernel","offset":673},{"match":"kernel","offset":789},{"match":"kernel","offset":1006},{"match":"kernel","offset":1171},{"match":"kernel","offset":1220}],"excerpt":"…eaming Multiprocessor (SM) 是 NVIDIA GPU 中的核心计算单元，每个 SM 包含多个 CUDA Core、Warp Scheduler、寄存器文件、共享内存和 L1 Cache。在本文研究的 NVIDIA Jetson TX2 上，GPU 有 2 个 SM，每个 SM 包含 128 个 CUDA Core（运行在 1.3GHz），共享 512KB L2 Cache。每个 SM 同时最多支持 2048 个线程、64KB shared memory、65536 个寄存器。Thread Block 被分配到 SM 上执行，一个 block 内的所有线程始终在同一 SM 上运行。\n从硬件架构角度拆解术语：\n在 TX2 的 Pascal GPU 中，每个 SM 内部有 4 个 Warp Scheduler。SM 接收从 EE queue dispatch 的 th…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fixed-to-Variable Dictionary Code for GPU Decoding（面向GPU解码的定长到可变字典编码）.md","basename":"Fixed-to-Variable Dictionary Code for GPU Decoding（面向GPU解码的定长到可变字典编码）","score":134.54042842272142,"foundWords":["l2","cache","kernel知识笔记","l2 cache"],"matches":[{"match":"L2 cache","offset":1445},{"match":"L2 cache","offset":1445},{"match":"cache","offset":1787}],"excerpt":"// 总计: 2^16 × 8 bytes = 512KB → GPU L2 cache resident\n```\n选择 14 对（28 权重）作为最大序列长度：4 bits 存 pair_count（0-14），恰好 fit UINT32 低 4 bits。\n术语一般如何实现？如何使用？\n- 字典生成：Algorithm 1 (max-priority queue)，以三元值对概率为优先级贪心扩展最高概率序列\n- 全局字典：一个字典服务所有 MoE 层/expert（避免 per-expert 存储开销）\n- 压缩率 vs 理论极限：20.07× (c2048) vs 25.40× (Shann