{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_05_j7p6kXWZJr7v36vSkedw4059","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/HBM (High Bandwidth Memory).md\",\"basename\":\"HBM (High Bandwidth Memory)\",\"score\":4404.363646944218,\"foundWords\":[\"hbm3\",\"hbm3（2022,\",\"hbm3e（2024,\",\"hbm3e\",\"hbm\",\"hbm在ai加速器中的使用方式\",\"hbm在attention计算中的典型数据流（标准attention,\",\"hbm在attention计算中的典型数据流\",\"hbm访问从35\",\"hbm2（2016,\",\"hbm2\",\"hbm2e，通过5120-bit\",\"hbm2e（2020,\",\"hbm2e为例）：\",\"hbm2e为例\",\"hbm2e\",\"hbm1\",\"hbm存储q\",\"hbm的代际演进：hbm1（2015,\",\"hbm的代际演进\",\"hbm的核心设计原理\",\"hbm是片外\",\"hbm（high\",\"bandwidth\",\"gpu\",\"gpu中hbm的物理组织和数据流（以a100\",\"gpu中hbm的物理组织和数据流\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Bandwidth\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"HBM（High\",\"offset\":77},{\"match\":\"Bandwidth\",\"offset\":86},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":204},{\"match\":\"HBM是片外\",\"offset\":209},{\"match\":\"HBM2e，通过5120-bit\",\"offset\":276},{\"match\":\"HBM的核心设计原理\",\"offset\":319},{\"match\":\"HBM存储Q\",\"offset\":421},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":512},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":527},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":546},{\"match\":\"GPU中HBM的物理组织和数据流（以A100\",\"offset\":632},{\"match\":\"HBM2e为例）：\",\"offset\":660},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":755},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1371},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1385},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1399},{\"match\":\"HBM在attention计算中的典型数据流（标准attention,\",\"offset\":1822},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1881},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1922},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1990},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":2050},{\"match\":\"HBM的代际演进：HBM1（2015,\",\"offset\":2148},{\"match\":\"HBM2（2016,\",\"offset\":2188},{\"match\":\"HBM2e（2020,\",\"offset\":2209},{\"match\":\"HBM3（2022,\",\"offset\":2238},{\"match\":\"HBM3e（2024,\",\"offset\":2266},{\"match\":\"HBM在AI加速器中的使用方式\",\"offset\":2294},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2343},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2356},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":2431},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":2457},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":2496},{\"match\":\"HBM访问从35\",\"offset\":2514},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":2577},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":2585}],\"excerpt\":\"## HBM (High Bandwidth Memory)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nHBM（High Bandwidth Memory，高带宽内存）是一种3D堆叠DRAM技术，通过硅通孔（TSV, Through-Silicon Via）将多层DRAM die垂直堆叠在logic die上，提供比传统GDDR高得多的带宽和更低的功耗。在GPU中，HBM是片外（off-chip）主内存，存储模型参数、激活值、优化器状态和中间张量。以NVIDIA A100为例：40GB或80GB HBM2e，通过5120-bit memory bus…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Memory Wall (存储墙 _ Memory Bandwidth Bottleneck in GPU Computing).md\",\"basename\":\"Memory Wall (存储墙 _ Memory Bandwidth Bottleneck in GPU Computing)\",\"score\":2431.999636755192,\"foundWords\":[\"hbm3→hbm3e\",\"hbm\",\"hbm:\",\"bandwidth\",\"bandwidth）增速的现象和由此产生的性能瓶颈。在\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Bandwidth\",\"offset\":29},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":53},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":129},{\"match\":\"bandwidth）增速的现象和由此产生的性能瓶颈。在\",\"offset\":176},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":320},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":324},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":473},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":477},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":696},{\"match\":\"HBM:\",\"offset\":860},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":948},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":952},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1106},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1168},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":1172},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":1224},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":1286},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1401},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":1405},{\"match\":\"HBM3→HBM3e\",\"offset\":1416},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1526}],\"excerpt\":\"## Memory Wall (存储墙 / Memory Bandwidth Bottleneck in GPU Computing)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMemory Wall 是描述 GPU 计算中计算吞吐（compute throughput）增速远超内存带宽（memory bandwidth）增速的现象和由此产生的性能瓶颈。在 FlashFuser 的 quantitative evidence 中：NVIDIA H100 的 FP16 peak compute 从前代 A100 的 300 TFLOPS 增长到约 1000 TFLOPS（3.3×），而 HBM bandw…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Memory-Bandwidth-Bound Decode in MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Memory-Bandwidth-Bound Decode in MoE\",\"score\":1288.3813162638958,\"foundWords\":[\"hbm3e\",\"hbm\",\"bandwidth\",\"bandwidth，ratio\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Bandwidth\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"Bandwidth\",\"offset\":93},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":361},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":401},{\"match\":\"bandwidth，ratio\",\"offset\":405},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":461},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":470},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":588},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":609},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":635},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":663},{\"match\":\"Bandwidth\",\"offset\":792},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1998},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":2010},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":2325},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":2528},{\"match\":\"HBM3e\",\"offset\":2731}],\"excerpt\":\"## Memory-Bandwidth-Bound Decode in MoE\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMemory-Bandwidth-Bound Decode 是 LYNX 识别并解决的 MoE 推理核心瓶颈。在 auto-regressive decode 阶段，每个 iteration 每个请求仅生成 1 个 token，导致 expert computation 的 arithmetic intensity（计算量/内存访问量之比）极低。对于 Qwen2-57B (k=8, N=64)，batch B=16 时 arithmetic i…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/NVIDIA H800 GPU (Hopper Architecture for LLM Serving).md\",\"basename\":\"NVIDIA H800 GPU (Hopper Architecture for LLM Serving)\",\"score\":1104.273185735031,\"foundWords\":[\"hbm3\",\"hbm\",\"hbm带宽约3\",\"bandwidth\",\"bandwidth:\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":93},{\"match\":\"HBM带宽约3\",\"offset\":343},{\"match\":\"HBM3\",\"offset\":365},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":575},{\"match\":\"Bandwidth:\",\"offset\":579},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1044}],\"excerpt\":\"## NVIDIA H800 GPU (Hopper Architecture for LLM Serving)\\n术语是什么？\\nNVIDIA H800是NVIDIA Hopper架构的GPU变体，专为中国市场设计，符合美国出口管制要求。与H100的关键区别在于NVLINK带宽和互连限制。LiquidGEMM论文使用H800 (80GB)作为实验平台。H800支持Hopper架构的全部计算特性：WGMMA指令（INT8 MMA peak ~990 TFLOPS）、TMA异步数据搬运、DPX指令、Transformer Engine（FP8支持）、mbarrier异步同步。H800的Tensor Core INT8吞吐与H1…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/2.5D Silicon Interposer (2.5D 硅中介层).md\",\"basename\":\"2.5D Silicon Interposer (2.5D 硅中介层)\",\"score\":211.425893557515,\"foundWords\":[\"hbm3\",\"hbm\",\"bandwidth\",\"gpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":149},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":155},{\"match\":\"HBM3\",\"offset\":361},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":712},{\"match\":\"bandwidth\",\"offset\":839},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1016},{\"match\":\"HBM\",\"offset\":1022}],\"excerpt\":\"2.5D silicon interposer 是一种封装集成技术，在 package substrate 和多个 dies（如 GPU + HBM stacks）之间插入一层硅中介层，通过硅基板上的微凸点（microbump）和硅通孔（TSV）实现 dies 之间的高速互联。相比传统 PCB 走线（毫米级线宽），silicon interposer 使用硅工艺的亚微米线宽金属层，实现更高的布线密度和信号完整性。Stratum 的 xPU die 和多个 Mono3D DRAM chips 通过 silicon interposer 互联，采用与 HBM3 兼容的 interposer I/O 标准（1024-bit data I/O, 6.4 Gbps/pin）。\\n从芯片设计角度拆解术语，比如术语如何在芯片设计中发挥…\"}],\"totalCount\":5,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes HBM3 HBM bandwidth GPU\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d6a322e-e190-4fae-a1dc-72c6a5bf18c5","uuid":"7ebe89e7-404e-4bcc-9332-5aeb33653b62","timestamp":"2026-05-31T09:45:06.859Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/HBM (High Bandwidth Memory).md\",\"basename\":\"HBM (High Bandwidth Memory)\",\"score\":4404.363646944218,\"foundWords\":[\"hbm3\",\"hbm3（2022,\",\"hbm3e（2024,\",\"hbm3e\",\"hbm\",\"hbm在ai加速器中的使用方式\",\"hbm在attention计算中的典型数据流（标准attention,\",\"hbm在attention计算中的典型数据流\",\"hbm访问从35\",\"hbm2（2016,\",\"hbm2\",\"hbm2e，通过5120-bit\",\"hbm2e（2020,\",\"hbm2e为例）：\",\"hbm2e为例\",\"hbm2e\",\"hbm1\",\"hbm存储q\",\"hbm的代际演进：hbm1（2015,\",\"hbm的代际演进\",\"hbm的核心设计原理\",\"hbm是片外\",\"hbm（high\",\"bandwidth\",\"gpu\",\"gpu中hbm的物理组织和数据流（以a100\",\