"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":2868},{\"match\":\"shared\",\"offset\":2886},{\"match\":\"memory发送给task\",\"offset\":2893},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":3004},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":3019},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":3221},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":3256},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":3333},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":3366},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":3394},{\"match\":\"memory\",\"offset\":3626}],\"excerpt\":\"## HuntKTm: Hybrid Scheduling and Automatic Management for Efficient Kernel Execution on Modern GPUs\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现是task scheduler，在multi-GPU系统中自动将多个任务（每个任务是包含多个kernel的独立GPU程序）调度到合适的GPU设备上，实现task-level并发执行。task scheduler包含三部分：(1) resource analyzer——编译期分析每个kernel的launch配置（thread数、register数、shared memory量）和memory object大小，汇总每个task的计算和内存资源需求；(2) lazy…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/ACS Concurrent Kernel Execution on Irregular, Input-Dependent Computational Graphs.md\",\"basename\":\"ACS Concurrent Kernel Execution on Irregular, Input-Dependent Computational Graphs\",\"score\":1669.6364325523577,\"foundWords\":[\"registers，32kb\",\"registers\",\"shared\",\"memory\",\"memory，128kb\",\"occupancy\",\"occupancy。\",\"kernel\",\"kernel实验笔记\",\"kernel，将其发射到自己的\",\"kernel；\",\"kernel。scheduler\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":173},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":217},{\"match\":\"kernel；\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"occupancy。\",\"offset\":592},{\"match\":\"registers，32KB\",\"offset\":870},{\"match\":\"shared\",\"offset\":885},{\"match\":\"memory，128KB\",\"offset\":892},{\"match\":\"registers，32KB\",\"offset\":1015},{\"match\":\"shared\",\"offset\":1030},{\"match\":\"memory，128KB\",\"offset\":1037},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1490},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1579},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1707},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1975},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2040},{\"match\":\"kernel